  {
    "name": "the default packet's NTP fraction is 0.287 s, not .1234567890",
    "input": {
      "packet": "81c8000c11111111e8754700499602d20036ee8000001388000c3500222222221a000005000005dc00000028aabbccdd0000303981ca0006111111110111616c696365406578616d706c652e636f6d00",
      "view": "fields"
    },
    "match": "subset",
    "fieldCount": 16,
    "why": "By hand: 0xe8754700 = 3900000000 s and 0x499602d2 = 1234567890, which is 1234567890 / 2^32 = 0.2874452 s; 3900000000 - 2208988800 = 1691011200 s after 1970, 2023-08-02T21:20:00Z. Version 1.1 printed 3900000000.1234567890, which reads as 0.123 s",
    "expect": {
      "kind": "fields",
      "fields": [
        {
          "label": "#1 NTP timestamp",
          "value": "3900000000.287445 s",
          "note": "2023-08-02T21:20:00.287Z"
        }
      ]
    }
